<section><div class="wrap">
<h2>How a cycle works</h2>
<p class="sub">4 cycles a year, planned.</p>
<ol class="steps">
<li>The clinic's medical team checks our health guides before anything is printed.</li>
<li>Student volunteers write a card for every mother and pack the kits.</li>
<li>We ship the kits and send funds for iron tablets, which the clinic buys locally.</li>
<li>Clinic staff give each mother her kit during prenatal care and tell us what to improve next time.</li>
</ol>
</div></section>

